{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_spot_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_spot_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "谁是英雄",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_spot_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4311d8f595825b0aec2285ef78fd01cc05d6adb89ba0d2d38438f1c4de4bc7f3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斑点哥哥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斑点哥哥，我来还漫画啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，门没有锁......斑点哥哥，不在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡普卡自己把漫画放回去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟、糟了，泡普卡把书架撞倒了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得把书架立起来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是这么多漫画都掉在地上......不知道哪本该放在什么地方......斑点哥哥，会生气吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先把标题一样的漫画堆到一起，等斑点哥哥回来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？为什么这本漫画没有标题？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泡普卡从书堆中拣出一个格格不入的皮面本子。纯色的封面上，除了灰尘什么都没有，没有标题，没有插画，甚至连一个字都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这本漫画该放哪一堆呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泡普卡打开本子，纸张有点泛黄。上面倒也有漫画，只不过那些线条显然不是印刷的产物，而是某个人自己用笔画下来的。\n虽然看起来不甚专业，漫画的内容却不是随意涂鸦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的膝盖，我的腿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博尔努，你就不能跟你爸说两句好话，给我们换个事儿少的长官吗？跟我们一起在这练一个小时匍匐前进，好玩吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "试过，没用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个博尔努，长得和斑点哥哥好像！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡普卡记得斑点哥哥的名字是叫......伯、博......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，伯克依·博尔努！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，这里，线条画到框外去了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungleentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "长官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍息——立正！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "长官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看你们成什么样子？松松垮垮，站没站相！前线的兄弟们每天流汗流血，你们呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "长官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居然还有人敢看什么漫画书——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "长官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——博尔努准将！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁看漫画了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "长官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "报告，是伯克依·博尔努！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泡普卡翻到下一页，一个拉远的镜头占了整整一页：\n士兵博尔努在宿舍里偷藏的漫画被搜了出来，堆在军营中央。\n在本子上画漫画的人细细地画出了那些漫画的封面、标题、册数，笔触很重，几乎把纸划破了。\n而周围的人被他几笔带过，甚至显得有些虚幻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungleentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全体都有——蹲下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博尔努，你不用蹲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你来把这些漫画里的台词一句不落地读一遍。你什么时候读完，他们什么时候站起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "报告，博尔努准将，漫画是我自己的，我可以自己蹲着读......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不干，他们就在这蹲到明天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就连这些胡编乱造的漫画都知道，一个人至少应该对自己造出来的烂摊子负责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "连这一点都做不到，你还好意思看什么英雄漫画？你想当英雄？你也配？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "青年把所有漫画读完，已经过了两个小时。\n士兵们原本还有些同情他，但蹲了两个小时之后，他们看青年的眼神里只剩下怨怼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看漫画，是这么坏的事情吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，一定是博尔努的父亲——一定是斑点哥哥的父亲误会了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那件事之后，整支队伍被送上前线。\n士兵们普遍觉得这是博尔努准将被儿子惹怒后的决定，士兵博尔努的处境越发难堪。\n终于，士兵博尔努选择逃跑。\n他尚未逃出军营就被巡逻兵抓住，敌人却恰好在此时袭来。\n敌人的攻势迅猛，本就士气不振的军队瞬间被冲垮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在这里没人，我们俩分头跑吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你那是什么表情？难道你事到如今才想起来你有个将军父亲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我恨他。他侮辱我，贬低我，说我永远成不了英雄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你还犹豫什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我不想事事顺他的意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你发烧了？脑子被震坏了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如我真的在战场上开溜，我的名字就会顺理成章地变成逃兵的名字，被他挂在嘴边，成为永远的耻辱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，然后呢？难道你还真想当什么英雄不成？先保住你自己那条小命吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也知道自己成不了英雄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我要是死了，那个老东西说不定会后悔，就算不后悔也无话可说；要是我活下来了，我要把他这些年嘲讽我的每一句话都原样还回去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是想跑就跑吧。这是我自己的事，我自己的家庭问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_barracks"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "长官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博尔努，出列！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "长官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了表彰博尔努在上次战斗中做出的贡献，特授予其二级英雄士兵奖章！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "长官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请博尔努自己朗读嘉奖令内容！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沉甸甸的奖章挂在胸前，嘉奖令拿在手中。\n青年压抑着汹涌的情感，在开始朗读之前扫视下面的人群，其中没有父亲的身影。\n带着半分遗憾和半分释然，他读了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......特予嘉奖，此令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "准将，博尔努。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博尔努......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡普卡就知道，斑点哥哥的父亲一定会和他和好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泡普卡擦了擦眼睛，翻到下一页，却只看到一片空白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "后面没有了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡普卡，你在看什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起，斑点哥哥，我不是故意把书架弄倒的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你当然不是故意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你在看的是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡普卡好喜欢这本漫画！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这本漫画是斑点哥哥画的自己的故事，对不对？泡普卡从来都不知道，原来斑点哥哥这么厉害！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个不是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不知为何，这句话到了嘴边，斑点却说不出口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡普卡，快到睡觉时间了，去找梓兰吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！明天还有例行训练，梓兰姐姐还在训练之后安排了聚餐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不说我都忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......斑点哥哥，生气了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有。跟月见夜我都没生过气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "斑点拿起本子，迟疑了片刻，转头整理起掉了满地的漫画。\n这些漫画他了如指掌，他看一眼背面的插图就知道这是哪个作者的哪一部漫画的第几册。整理这些东西要不了多长时间。\n所有漫画都归位之后，斑点再次看向那个皮面本子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，我得去跟泡普卡说一声，让她别把刚刚看的东西告诉别人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么英雄啊，我早都死心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如，至少在泡普卡他们面前，我能像个英雄一样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不可能。我根本不是那块料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聚餐，聚餐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，聚餐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（叹气声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多亏大家第二次实战训练的时候表现不错，要不然聚餐可就泡汤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼哼，为了不被杜宾教官留下加训，我可是使出了浑身解数！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......七八成总是有的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恕我直言，今天的例行训练，大家的表现都堪称完美。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，如果要评选今天训练中表现最好的一位，我只能当仁不让、勉为其难，推荐我自己了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A6组员们",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧啧，如此冷淡的反应，真是令人痛心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尤其是你，斑点老兄，不打算对我完美的战斗发表一些意见吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚刚在想事情，没听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多么冷淡的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，月见夜，闭嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（优雅地耸肩）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过我说实话，今天表现最好的其实是斑点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天第一次实战时，斑点哥哥的动作怪怪的，好像要跟杜宾教官一对一战斗一样，泡普卡有点担心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但第二次实战就不一样了！斑点哥哥的治疗很及时，还帮泡普卡挡下了杜宾教官的攻击！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那一挡很关键的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到杜宾教官攻击的角度就知道要糟，没想到斑点像瞬间移动一样顶上了那个位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是斑点补位及时，杜宾教官肯定会在泡普卡被命中之后冲着我来，要是那样，我们就崩盘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确有其事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斑点老兄在第一次实战中的英雄气概，在第二次实战中的机智灵活，都差一点就让我甘拜下风——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "月见夜，少说两句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斑点他......心情不太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以泡普卡还是告诉你了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（点头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么......为什么大家突然不高兴了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斑点哥哥，是泡普卡不该把漫画的事告诉——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡普卡，现在先不要说这个，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以说——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，聚餐！梓兰姐，今天食堂人会不会很多啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别担心，有我们心思缜密的梓兰小姐在，就算再怎么拥挤，我们也能在食堂占据一席之地，我说得没错吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斑点哥哥，不要生气......泡普卡错了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天说过了，我没生气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是......有些话，不知道该不该说，没想好该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像——嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "月见夜，随便讲点什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？终于，斑点你也需要从我头脑的深井中汲取灵感了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，我头一次听人说自己的脑袋里全是水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡普卡，所谓“没想好该怎么说”，就相当于只想到了“呃”，还没想到“脑袋里全是水”。明白了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总之，等到了食堂，我会讲清楚的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，泡普卡没做错？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那泡普卡可以把斑点哥哥的事迹告诉大家吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡普卡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事，说吧，泡普卡。你替我说了，我正好少说两句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_canteen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斑点，看不出来，你以前竟然这么厉害？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在败军之际收拢残兵，让二百人重新归队？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然很不甘心，但我不得不说，这可是实打实让我甘拜下风的战绩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被别人知道这种事，有什么好不高兴的？如果是我，我一定会将那枚勋章一直挂在胸前，向所有人展示我的英雄事迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没得到勋章。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们没给你授勋？多么严重的失察行为——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "斑点抓起面包咬了一口。\n他以为自己会狠狠咬下去，然后在发力这一行为中得到一点勇气。\n但他没有。\n他下颚用力的方式与平时别无二致，从咀嚼到吞咽都顺滑无比，连他自己都没想到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为我根本就没收拢什么残兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个晚上，敌人攻来之后，我身边很快就一个人也不剩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我抓住机会从包围中逃了出去，然后......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "斑点几乎是刻意地停了下来，喝了口果汁。\n他怕自己哽住，但他又多虑了。\n他曾经决定把这段经历永远隐藏下去。\n而此时此刻，他猛然发现，在这些朝夕相处的伙伴面前，瞒住不说才是更加困难的选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有什么逆反心理，也没有什么收拢残兵，更没有什么授勋仪式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我逃了，就这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对于一个被全军讨厌的兵来说，逃走既符合大家的期待，又适合自己的性格。这叫适才适所，物尽其用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是真跑上去假装英雄，那才是不解风情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斑点，你也不必这么说自己......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梓兰，你也是，你一定是觉得那样的英雄事迹和我对不上号，这才不想让泡普卡告诉大家的，没错吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一阵沉默。\n对A6组来说，这样的沉默颇为罕见。\n斑点环顾四周。\n泡普卡有些沮丧，月见夜则是一脸轻浮；梓兰稍微有点紧张，不停用勺子搅咖啡，空爆还是一贯的坐没坐相。\n这些人唯一的共同点是，斑点能从他们身上感受到丝毫不掺假的关切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后你......画了泡普卡说的那个漫画？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那支部队其实蠢透了，当年我乖乖听老头子安排去那里受罪，其实脑子里的水不比现在的月见夜少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "军官从来不把士兵当人看，每个月都有士兵因为过量训练倒下，最后还要为了王酋之间毫无意义的摩擦流血......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要说那段经历有什么好处，大概只有炎热的天气吧。高温把我脑子里的水蒸干了，让我终于想到了逃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但是......\n假如我不逃，会怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很长一段时间，我摆脱不了这个念头，最终就有了那本自我美化的涂鸦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "画的时候，我一度傻乎乎地幻想，要是当时没跑，说不定老头子会对我刮目相看的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......斑点老兄，恕我直言，以我对你这个人精准的认识，我可以断言，这不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "月见夜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系，让他说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很久很久以前，当我仍旧以东夜魔王的名号纵横业界的时候，我曾有一位努力的同事，他以犀利的言辞闻名——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然只听了个开头，但我有种不祥的预感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你这位同事因为什么理由进了东国的军队，结果无论如何也适应不了，那可真是太令人扼腕叹息了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（讪笑）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然你这个故事编得让人一眼望到底，但至少中心思想没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你月见夜哪天成了公认的英雄，我大概会对人类的理性彻底失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但要是哪天我成了公认的英雄，我怕是要被人类的愚蠢吓疯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说到底，我只是在家庭中耳濡目染，被灌输了一个根本不适合自己的梦想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，那本涂鸦画到授勋就结束了，因为我贫瘠的想象力最多只能想到那一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再往后，一个真成了英雄的博尔努该怎么继续他的英雄事迹，我想破了头也想不出来，因为那根本就是自相矛盾的产物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡普卡，开始听不懂了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听不懂也没关系，等泡普卡长大了就会明白的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可泡普卡，是不是做了坏事，让斑点哥哥不得不说了不想说的话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完全没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实，多亏了泡普卡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（挠头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（眼神游移）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（尴尬地清嗓子）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斑点哥哥，生病了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这可不是生病哦，泡普卡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可斑点哥哥，看起来不太舒服......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他在酝酿一些从出生开始从来没说过的肉麻——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——月见夜，你想好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不，赞美的话，第一次跟别人说这种话总是很尴尬的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算玲珑剔透如我，在接待自己的首位客人时，也是手忙脚乱啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说是吧，斑点老兄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "月见夜，明天要不要约个一对一训练？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我很乐意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那我把刚才的话说完——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——多亏了泡普卡，我才发现......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）......向最信任的人吐露这段可笑的“英雄事迹”，似乎比一直藏着要更舒服一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白了，斑点老兄的意思是，我们已经是他最信任的人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斑点，你现在要是想揍他，我没有任何意见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梓兰小姐——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然这句话被他一复述还是一如既往地恶心，但是，看在内容没错的份上......算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就对了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我提议，为了斑点今天给我们讲的故事，干杯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A6组组员们",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "干杯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，假英雄的煽情故事到此为止——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可斑点哥哥就是英雄嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斑点哥哥帮泡普卡挡住了攻击，保护了大家，帮大家赶上了聚餐，斑点哥哥就是英雄！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡普卡要给斑点哥哥举办授勋仪式！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A6组组员们",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "授勋仪式上要有泡普卡，有梓兰姐姐、空爆姐姐、月见夜哥哥......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，不行......人不够！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡普卡再想想——对了，还有泡泡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个，泡普卡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "char_281_popka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有巫恋姐姐、铃兰姐姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梓兰、空爆，搭把手，我有预感，今天我们要有一场苦战了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我打算跟食堂管理员说是你惹泡普卡闹起来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我觉得你有权回宿舍，为自己的工资哀悼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我，斑点老兄，我来给你送件东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给，这是泡普卡送你的“英雄证书”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英雄证书？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们不是磨破嘴皮，说服泡普卡放弃授勋仪式的傻念头了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回宿舍之后，泡普卡又有了新想法，这次谁也劝不住她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总之，这是她手绘的英雄证书，给你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她还要求我们在上面签上自己的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们签了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在就差你的啦。只要你把自己的名字签上去，你就是A6组全员一致通过的英雄了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "斑点没有接话。\n他用两手捧着那张“英雄证书”，上面写着泡普卡能想出的最正式的“颁奖词”，四周还画着稚拙的装饰画和花边。\n斑点把“颁奖词”细细读了一遍，然后，在手感厚实的纸张最下方，看到了四个人的签名。\n他心里一热。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么样，需不需要我借你一支高级钢笔，好让你的名字在其中显得与众不同？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那倒不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "斑点并未签字，而是从储物柜里拿出了一个精美的相框，将“英雄证书”装饰在其中。\n他把相框放在床头最显眼的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这可不行，斑点老兄，你就这么放弃签字，泡普卡可是会闹的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是怕泡普卡闹，你是怕泡普卡一闹起来，梓兰就会找你麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "精准的判断！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夸我也没用，我是不会签的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和当英雄相比，还是现在的生活更适合我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么，不说点什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是太感动，我终于用自己的真情融化了斑点老兄如同坚冰一般的心——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......月见夜，我突然改主意了。英雄好像也不是特别难做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "speakerId": "char_283_midn",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次再和你出任务的时候，我给你偷偷安排一个暴脾气的姑娘让你去搭讪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "speakerId": "char_284_spot",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到你被揍得去医务室躺上个十天半个月，到时候我就是整个A6组的英雄了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "二人相对大笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
